          "outlet": "The Hindu",
          "url": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/tanker-hit-by-projectile-near-strait-of-hormuz-was-operating-in-dark-mode/article71469903.ece",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "The MT El Gaia had 25 crew members on board, including 14 Indian and 11 Pakistani nationals.",
          "kind": "figure",
          "outlet": "The Hindu",
          "url": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/tanker-hit-by-projectile-near-strait-of-hormuz-was-operating-in-dark-mode/article71469903.ece",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "Pakistani Third Engineer Muhammad Hammad Obaida and Indian Oiler Sumit Kumar Singh remain unaccounted for after being on watch in the engine room of MT El Gaia when it was hit.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "The Hindu",
          "url": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/tanker-hit-by-projectile-near-strait-of-hormuz-was-operating-in-dark-mode/article71469903.ece",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "The Omani Coast Guard transferred 23 remaining crew members from MT El Gaia ashore following the attack.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "The Hindu",
          "url": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/tanker-hit-by-projectile-near-strait-of-hormuz-was-operating-in-dark-mode/article71469903.ece",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "Iran's IRGC Navy stated that the MT El Gaia struck naval mines while using an illegal route, whereas the US stated the vessel was hit by a missile and a drone.",
          "kind": "quote",
          "outlet": "The Hindu",
          "url": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/tanker-hit-by-projectile-near-strait-of-hormuz-was-operating-in-dark-mode/article71469903.ece",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "Saudi Crown Prince Mohammed bin Salman and Egyptian President Abdel Fattah al-Sisi called for free and secure navigation in the Red Sea during talks in Cairo.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "France 24",
          "url": "http://www.france24.com/en/saudi-crown-prince-seeks-neighbours-backing-as-houthi-attacks-rattle-red-sea-oil-routes",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "The Saudi-backed Yemeni government recently lost key coastal territories vital for oil shipping to the Iran-aligned Houthis.",
          "kind": "background",
          "outlet": "Al Jazeera",
          "url": "https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/9/15/egypts-sisi-meets-mbs-backs-saudi-call-for-secure-red-sea-navigation?traffic_source=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "Egypt lost approximately $7 billion between 2023 and 2024, or about 60 percent of the Suez Canal's revenues, due to reduced Red Sea transit.",
          "kind": "figure",
          "outlet": "Al Jazeera",
          "url": "https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/9/15/egypts-sisi-meets-mbs-backs-saudi-call-for-secure-red-sea-navigation?traffic_source=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "An estimated 100,000 Yemenis have been displaced amid renewed fighting across Yemen.",
          "kind": "figure",
          "outlet": "Guardian World",
          "url": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/sep/15/houthis-threaten-saudi-arabia-strikes-un-warning-humanitarian-crisis-yemen",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "The price of Brent crude rose nearly 3% to $108 a barrel following news that loadings at Saudi Arabia's Red Sea port of Yanbu were suspended.",
          "kind": "figure",
          "outlet": "Guardian World",
          "url": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/sep/15/houthis-threaten-saudi-arabia-strikes-un-warning-humanitarian-crisis-yemen",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "Saudi Aramco closed its East-West pipeline due to an attack by Yemen's Iran-aligned Houthis.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "Guardian World",
          "url": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/sep/15/houthis-threaten-saudi-arabia-strikes-un-warning-humanitarian-crisis-yemen",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "Only four ships were recorded crossing the Strait of Hormuz on Monday, compared with a prewar daily average of about 130 ships.",
          "kind": "figure",
          "outlet": "Guardian World",
          "url": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/sep/15/houthis-threaten-saudi-arabia-strikes-un-warning-humanitarian-crisis-yemen",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "Houthi rebel forces seized the Yemeni port of Mokha and Mayyun Island overlooking the Bab el-Mandab strait.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "Scroll.in",
          "url": "https://scroll.in/article/1095761/divide-among-brics-nations-exposed-as-houthi-rebels-seize-oil-chokepoint-in-red-sea?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=public",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "BRICS leaders assembled in New Delhi for their 18th annual summit, issuing a declaration with no mention of the Red Sea, Bab el-Mandab, Yemen, or the Houthis.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "Scroll.in",
          "url": "https://scroll.in/article/1095761/divide-among-brics-nations-exposed-as-houthi-rebels-seize-oil-chokepoint-in-red-sea?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=public",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "The UAE suspended all trade and financial transactions with Iran in late August after Iran allegedly attacked an Abu Dhabi National Oil Company ship in the Strait of Hormuz.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "Scroll.in",
          "url": "https://scroll.in/article/1095761/divide-among-brics-nations-exposed-as-houthi-rebels-seize-oil-chokepoint-in-red-sea?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=public",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        }
