          "text": "Federal prosecutors in Texas charged six lawful permanent residents and one undocumented immigrant for voting in federal elections over the past eight years.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "Guardian World",
          "url": "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/live/2026/sep/15/supreme-court-mail-ballot-restrictions-midterm-elections-trump-ai-politics-latest-news-updates",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "cluster_id": 3,
          "text": "The US Supreme Court rejected the Trump administration's plan to implement new Postal Service restrictions on mail-in ballots ahead of the November 3 midterms.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "Al Jazeera",
          "url": "https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/9/15/blanche-says-admin-will-comply-with-mail-ballot-ruling-defends-trump?traffic_source=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "cluster_id": 3,
          "text": "Justice Brett Kavanaugh concurred with the Supreme Court decision, stating that state and local officials lacked enough time to implement the mail ballot rule before the election.",
          "kind": "quote",
          "outlet": "Al Jazeera",
          "url": "https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/9/15/blanche-says-admin-will-comply-with-mail-ballot-ruling-defends-trump?traffic_source=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "cluster_id": 3,
          "text": "President Donald Trump attacked Justices Neil Gorsuch, Brett Kavanaugh, and Amy Coney Barrett on Truth Social, stating they are not the people he interviewed.",
          "kind": "quote",
          "outlet": "Al Jazeera",
          "url": "https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/9/15/blanche-says-admin-will-comply-with-mail-ballot-ruling-defends-trump?traffic_source=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "cluster_id": 3,
          "text": "Supreme Court Justices Samuel Alito and Clarence Thomas dissented from the ruling that blocked the mail-in ballot restrictions.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "Times of India",
          "url": "https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/trump-slams-3-justices-he-nominated-after-mail-voting-setback-not-the-people-i-interviewed/articleshow/134266970.cms",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "cluster_id": 3,
          "text": "US District Judge Deborah Boardman issued a preliminary injunction on September 2 blocking Donald Trump's executive order targeting birth tourism.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "Livemint",
          "url": "https://www.livemint.com/news/us-news/horrible-highly-political-ruling-trump-attacks-supreme-court-after-mail-in-voting-setback-11789480143233.html",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "cluster_id": 3,
          "text": "Mail-in voting for the midterm elections has already begun in states including Alabama, North Carolina, and Wisconsin.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "NPR World",
          "url": "https://www.npr.org/2026/09/15/g-s1-143294/up-first-newsletter-bernie-sanders-steve-bannon-ai-mail-in-ballots-kennedy-center-emmys",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        }
      ]
