          "cluster_id": 4,
          "text": "Russia and China warned of an arms race in outer space following the US confirmation of an orbital weapon deployment.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "BBC World",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/videos/cmn07yjqg5rwo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "cluster_id": 4,
          "text": "US Air Force Secretary Troy Meink stated at a conference that the US has on-orbit space control weapons capable of defending forces against hostile adversary action.",
          "kind": "quote",
          "outlet": "Times of India",
          "url": "https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/good-heavens-us-reveals-it-has-placed-weapons-in-space/articleshow/134269076.cms",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "cluster_id": 4,
          "text": "Victoria Samson of the Secure World Foundation suggested that the newly acknowledged US space systems could be space-based jammers.",
          "kind": "background",
