          "outlet": "NDTV",
          "url": "https://www.ndtv.com/india-news/upi-charges-explained-who-pays-for-upi-transactions-how-much-is-upi-charge-12051163#publisher=newsstand",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
